250, 20           ! proton and electron beam energy
5000,100       ! Number of events 
1e-09, 0.99       ! xmin and xmax
1e-09,1.00        ! ymin and ymax 
1e-09,10       ! Q2min and Q2max 
F2PY,1998         ! F2-Model, R-Parametrisation
